Q: Stop Browsersync from opening a browser tab [webpack.mx.js] A: <blockquote>
<p>I'd rather it just serve to a port and let me open that tab myself</p>
</blockquote>
<p>You can disable the <a href="https://github.com/laravel-mix/laravel-mix/blob/v6.0.43/types/browsersync.d.ts#L178" rel="nofollow noreferrer">open option</a> passed</p>
<pre class="lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>mix.browserSync({
    open: false
});

</code></pre>
